---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Cookie Policy — Dream Dictionary"
  description="How Dream Dictionary uses cookies and how you can control them."
>
  <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
  <p><em>Last updated: August 2026</em></p>

  <p>
    This Cookie Policy explains what cookies are, which ones we use, and how
    you can control them. It should be read alongside our
    <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>What are cookies?</h2>
  <p>
    Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a
    website. They help websites function properly, remember preferences, and
    (for advertising cookies) understand browsing behavior across sites.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies we use</h2>

  <h3>Essential cookies</h3>
  <p>
    Used for core site functionality. The site currently doesn't require
    accounts or logins, so essential cookie use is minimal.
  </p>

  <h3>Analytics cookies</h3>
  <p>
    If enabled, tools like Google Analytics use cookies to understand how
    visitors use the site (pages viewed, time on site, general location) so
    we can improve content. This data is aggregated and doesn't identify you
    personally.
  </p>

  <h3>Advertising cookies</h3>
  <p>
    If we enable advertising (e.g. Google AdSense), third-party cookies may
    be used to show ads that are more relevant to you, based on your visits
    to this and other sites. These cookies are set by the advertising
    provider, not directly by us.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>
    You can control or delete cookies through your browser settings — most
    browsers let you block cookies entirely, block third-party cookies only,
    or clear existing cookies. Note that blocking essential cookies may
    affect site functionality.
  </p>
  <p>
    For advertising cookies specifically, you can opt out of personalized
    ads from Google at
    <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>,
    or via industry opt-out tools like
    <a href="https://optout.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener">aboutads.info</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this Cookie Policy as we add or change tools on the site.
    Changes will be posted here with an updated date.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact us</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about our cookie use? Email
    <a href="mailto:hello@oneirahome.com">hello@oneirahome.com</a>.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
